470
00:38:00,596 --> 00:38:05,736
ゼッタイなってやるーっ！
I'll definitely become one!

471
00:38:06,596 --> 00:38:13,316
ああ あこがれの ポケモンマスターに なりたいな ならなくちゃ
Ah, I want to become a longed-for Pokémon Master, I've got to be one!

472
00:38:16,596 --> 00:38:22,036
ゼッタイなってやるーっ！
I'll definitely become one!

473
00:38:36,776 --> 00:38:44,276
はーい！という拠点で、なんと、今回こうやってホロライブに紛れ込んできたのは松本梨香さんでしたー！
"Ha-i! And so, the one who sneaked into Hololive this time was none other than Rica Matsumoto-san!"

474
00:38:44,516 --> 00:38:47,396
どうもー！さっそく、レジェンド松本梨香でーす！
"Hello! Introducing the legend herself, Rica Matsumoto!"

475
00:38:47,536 --> 00:38:49,056
にかんねー！
"Nikan-ne!"

476
00:38:49,056 --> 00:38:57,196
にかんねーとはですね、えー以前ホロライブのファンクラブの番組、ホロテスでご一緒させていただきまして、
"Speaking of 'nikan-ne,' um, we previously appeared together on Hololive's fan club program, HoloTest."

477
00:38:57,536 --> 00:38:59,056
久しぶりだね。
"It's been a while."

478
00:38:59,056 --> 00:39:02,156
そう、久しぶりです！元気？元気です！あけましておめでとうございます！
"Yeah, it's been a while! How are you? I'm good! Happy New Year!"

479
00:39:02,756 --> 00:39:04,376
ちょっと痩せた？
"Did you lose a bit of weight?"

480
00:39:04,376 --> 00:39:13,176
え、あ、あー分かります？ちょっとあのボンキュッボンに磨きがかかってたんですけど（笑）
"Eh, ah, ah, you can tell? I've been polishing up my hourglass figure, you know! (Laughs)"

481
00:39:13,456 --> 00:39:18,056
えー、あの、あともう一つ、ちょっとアピールしたいことがあって……
"Um, also, there's one more thing I want to appeal..."

482
00:39:14,176 --> 00:39:15,556
全然言ってるけど大丈夫？
"You're saying anything, are you okay?"

483
00:39:15,556 --> 00:39:17,056
全然大丈夫です！ちょっと呼吸を整えて……
"Completely fine! Let me just catch my breath..."

484
00:39:16,196 --> 00:39:17,396
息を整えていいよ。
"Take your time to breathe."

485
00:39:17,576 --> 00:39:18,176
あ、ありがとうございます。
"Ah, thank you."

486
00:39:18,176 --> 00:39:22,536
ふー。ありがとうございます。うんうん、何々？
"Whew. Thank you. Yeah, yeah, what is it?"

487
00:39:23,096 --> 00:39:27,196
実は、あのコヨリ、今日で一つ大人になったんです。
"Actually, Koyori became an adult today."

488
00:39:27,296 --> 00:39:36,216
え、どこどこと？ 大人の階段上る……え、何々？ あ、上ったんです、あの、要するにバースデー……え、ハッピーバースデー！？
"Eh, where, where? Climbing the stairs to adulthood... Eh, what? Ah, you climbed them, um, in short, birthday... Eh, Happy Birthday!?"

489
00:39:36,236 --> 00:39:36,896
やった！はい！
"Yay! Yes!"

490
00:39:37,396 --> 00:39:41,896
Happy birthday to you~♪ Happy birthday to you~♪

491
00:39:42,136 --> 00:39:47,396
Happy birthday, Koyori—! ちょっとネイティブ出ちゃいました。
"Happy birthday, Koyori—! My native pronunciation slipped out a bit."

492
00:39:47,396 --> 00:39:50,076
めっちゃ発音良かった！ Happy birthday to you~♪
"Your pronunciation was so good! Happy birthday to you~♪"

493
00:39:50,336 --> 00:39:59,076
イェーイ！にかんねー、ありがとうございます！
"Yay! Nikan-ne, thank you so much!"

494
00:40:00,308 --> 00:40:04,968
え、じゅ、じゅじゅもって、その、あの、年、あ、ハッピーバースデー迎えたってことで、
Uh, since you've just celebrated your birthday,

495
00:40:05,168 --> 00:40:06,468
えーと、抱負、
um, your aspirations...

496
00:40:06,976 --> 00:40:07,476
抱負？
Aspirations?

497
00:40:07,626 --> 00:40:15,716
あ、でも、あの、今一緒に歌わせていただいて、ものすごいもうやっぱ声量にビクンビクンさせられまして、
Ah, but... singing with you just now, I was really blown away by your incredible vocal volume!

498
00:40:15,806 --> 00:40:18,876
そうそう、あの小さいときからね、あの声は、あの本当にでかいんだよね。
That's right, since I was little, my voice has actually been really loud.

499
00:40:18,976 --> 00:40:20,546
いやも本当にすごい！
No, it really is amazing!

500
00:40:20,546 --> 00:40:27,766
もうそれを感じて、より、あの、歌今年頑張ろうっていうのが、もともと抱負だったんですけど、より思いました。
Feeling that, I felt even more motivated to work hard on my singing this year—which was already my resolution, but it made me feel it even more.

501
00:40:27,766 --> 00:40:28,966
そうだね。はい。
That's right. Yes.

502
00:40:29,136 --> 00:40:33,286
うん、そうそう。まあ、楽しく歌えばいいんですよ、歌なんて。あの、めちゃくちゃ楽しかったし、もうこれ。
Yeah, exactly. Well, you should just have fun singing, you know? It was super fun, and...

503
00:40:33,786 --> 00:40:37,826
だってほら、あの、音楽ってやっぱり音を楽しむじゃんか。ね。
Because look, music is about enjoying sound, right? Right.

504
00:40:37,826 --> 00:40:45,036
だからその、楽しむっていうのが一番のエネルギーになりますからね。
So enjoying it is the ultimate source of energy, after all.

505
00:40:45,036 --> 00:40:55,836
いや、でも本当に一緒に歌わせていただけて、めちゃくちゃ楽しかったです！ありがとうございました！
Yes, but really, getting to sing together with you was so much fun! Thank you very much!

506
00:40:55,936 --> 00:40:56,946
よかったです。
I'm glad.

507
00:40:56,946 --> 00:40:59,696
いや、なんか恐縮しすぎかもしれないけど。
I might be being too intimidated, though.

508
00:41:00,076 --> 00:41:07,546
よくね、みんなちっちゃいころからっていうのよ。それちょっとね、どのくらいていうふうに思っちゃって、はい。でもありがたいですね、本当に。
People often say "ever since I was little," and I end up wondering just how little, haha. But I'm really grateful, truly.

509
00:41:07,706 --> 00:41:09,976
ありがたいです。いや、本当にありがとうございます！
I'm so grateful. No, thank you really so much!

510
00:41:09,976 --> 00:41:14,716
ということで、こここよラボというこよりのラボなんですけど、
So, this is "KoyoLabo," Koyori's laboratory, but...

511
00:41:14,716 --> 00:41:17,446
バーチャル世界どうですか？
how do you like the virtual world?

512
00:41:17,496 --> 00:41:19,056
え、すごい素敵！やんだ！
Wow, it's so wonderful! Yay!

513
00:41:19,226 --> 00:41:22,456
でもなんかずっとなんかいろんなのが動いてて落ち着かないんだけど。
But you know, with so many things moving constantly, I can't settle down!

514
00:41:22,536 --> 00:41:23,766
すみません、ちょっと。
Sorry about that, haha.

515
00:41:23,766 --> 00:41:27,566
あのね、コンベアに、コンベアに乗ってみたい、そのコンベアに。
You know, I want to ride the conveyor belt over there.

516
00:41:27,766 --> 00:41:30,046
え、乗ってくれるんですか？乗って帰っていいかな？
Eh, will you ride it? Can I ride it back?

517
00:41:30,196 --> 00:41:34,266
あれに乗ったらもれなくこよりの助手君になれるっていうおまけ付きなんですけど。そうなんだ。
If you ride that, you get the bonus of becoming Koyori's assistant without exception. Is that right?

518
00:41:34,266 --> 00:41:36,696
じゃ、りかね、今日からこよりの助手君ということで。
Well, Rikane, from today you're Koyori's assistant, then.

519
00:41:36,696 --> 00:41:37,556
いや、じゃあいいわ。
No, then I'm good.

520
00:41:37,666 --> 00:41:42,986
ええ！じゃなくっていいから乗ってください、あとで。
Eh?! Never mind that, please just ride it later!

521
00:41:43,146 --> 00:41:48,486
ということで、ここよアイランドもこれからもちょっともうちょっと楽しんでいただければと思います。ありがとうございました！
With that, I hope you'll continue to enjoy Koyo Island a bit more. Thank you very much!

522
00:41:48,886 --> 00:41:50,146
ありがとうございました。
Thank you very much!

523
00:41:50,146 --> 00:41:56,576
ということで、松本リカねでした！ありがとうございました！じゃあ乗って帰ろうかな。
And with that, it was Rika Matsumoto! Thank you very much! Well then, I guess I'll ride back.

524
00:41:59,564 --> 00:42:03,264
あ、乗っている。
Ah, she's riding it.

525
00:42:06,564 --> 00:42:10,564
わ～、びっくりなゲストだったな～、楽しかった～！
Wow~, what a surprising guest, that was so fun~!

526
00:42:12,064 --> 00:42:17,564
！？な、なんだ！？急に目の前が真っ暗に！
!? W-What!? Suddenly everything in front of me went pitch black!

527
00:42:19,886 --> 00:42:22,626
そこに誓い立て！敗って捨てるような現実は
Make your vow right there! A miracle you'd tear up and throw away

528
00:42:22,626 --> 00:42:24,346
一刀両断 叩き斬る
Cut it down with a single stroke of the blade!

529
00:42:24,346 --> 00:42:26,606
終わりなき輪廻に迷いし恋だよ
It's love lost in endless reincarnation,

530
00:42:26,606 --> 00:42:29,626
漆黒の翼でいざなおう
Let me guide you with wings of pitch black!

531
00:42:29,906 --> 00:42:35,946
我ら エデンの星を滑るもの 秘密結社 ホロックスでござる！
We are those who glide across the stars of Eden—the secret society, holoX!

532
00:42:40,126 --> 00:42:42,426
会いたかったよ 会いたかったわ
I wanted to see you! I wanted to see you!

533
00:42:42,426 --> 00:42:43,826
会いたかった 会いたかった
I wanted to see you! I wanted to see you!

534
00:42:43,826 --> 00:42:46,126
会いたかったです やっと会えました
I wanted to see you! We finally met!

535
00:42:46,426 --> 00:42:51,706
大好きって気持ちは 回って回って増えてく
My feelings of "I love you" go round and round, increasing more and more,

536
00:42:51,706 --> 00:42:55,786
溢れて止まらない 君にちゃんと届くように
Overflowing and unstoppable, so that they properly reach you!

537
00:42:59,946 --> 00:43:04,966
こんこよアイランド楽しんでる？最後はライブステージを楽しんでいってね！
Are you enjoying Koyo Island? Enjoy the live stage until the very end!

538
00:43:04,966 --> 00:43:09,626
イェイ！ 1・2・3・4・5！
Yay! 1, 2, 3, 4, 5!

539
00:43:10,086 --> 00:43:15,646
止まったままの ゴニン　すれ違う気持ち
Five people standing still, passing each other by in feeling,

540
00:43:15,646 --> 00:43:21,626
君のその心が 溶かしていく
Your heart is melting it all away.

541
00:43:21,906 --> 00:43:27,026
特別な形は 消えない奇跡描く
Special forms draw an unerasable miracle,

542
00:43:27,026 --> 00:43:35,546
これからも ずっと ずっと 変わらないで
From now on, always, always, without changing—

543
00:43:36,064 --> 00:43:41,864
大好きって気持ちは 回って回って増えてく
My feelings of "I love you" go round and round, increasing more and more,

544
00:43:41,864 --> 00:43:47,446
大切なんだ 全部 一つ一つ抱きしめて
They are precious, embracing every single one of them,

545
00:43:47,726 --> 00:43:53,666
ヒトの間だってほら 言葉を不二にしてゆこう
Between humans too—look, let's make our words undeniable.

546
00:43:53,946 --> 00:43:59,946
溢れて止まらない 君にちゃんと届くように
Overflowing and unstoppable, so that they properly reach you!

547
00:44:06,126 --> 00:44:11,786
分かり合っても どれもゆづれない気持ち
Even if we understand each other, feelings we won't yield to anyone—

548
00:44:11,786 --> 00:44:17,446
何が大切かって 気づいてく
What is truly important, we realize step by step.

549
00:44:17,446 --> 00:44:25,026
切り替わった形は 永遠の奇跡紡ぐ まっすぐな
Changing forms spin an eternal miracle, straight ahead—

550
00:44:26,426 --> 00:44:31,626
君に 君に 光でてゆく
Shining toward you, toward you—

551
00:44:31,926 --> 00:44:37,466
大好きって言い合ったら もっと もっと 高鳴る
If we tell each other "I love you," our hearts beat even faster and higher,

552
00:44:37,466 --> 00:44:43,746
会いたいんだ 今すぐ はやる気持ち駆け出して
I want to see you right now, my eager heart starts running,

553
00:44:43,746 --> 00:44:50,106
ちょっと待って止まらない ドキドキしてる 一瞬も忘れない
Wait a second, it won't stop, my heart is pounding, I won't forget a single moment—

554
00:44:50,106 --> 00:44:56,106
あの日いつも夢に見る
The dream I always see on that day—

555
00:45:00,118 --> 00:45:01,958
響かせよう
Let it resonate,

556
00:45:02,238 --> 00:45:04,458
それぞれの日々の交差点で
at the crossroads of our daily lives,

557
00:45:04,458 --> 00:45:08,138
遠くまで続いていく sky & field
stretching far into the sky & field.

558
00:45:08,138 --> 00:45:10,818
みんなの歌の harmony
Everyone's singing in harmony.

559
00:45:10,818 --> 00:45:13,598
環境が違うね 家庭や職場それに学校
Different environments—home, work, and school,

560
00:45:13,598 --> 00:45:15,598
それぞれで頑張ってんだ
all working hard in our own ways.

561
00:45:15,598 --> 00:45:17,558
しんどい事も泣けちゃう事もあるだろう
There are tough times and moments we might cry,

562
00:45:17,558 --> 00:45:20,198
色々乗り越えてんだ
